1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,473
Finally, deficiency diseases.

2
00:00:02,473 --> 00:00:11,393
Too little protein and energy: kwashiorkor, which swells with oedema, and marasmus, which shrinks to skin and bone.

3
00:00:11,393 --> 00:00:14,179
Vitamin A: night blindness.

4
00:00:14,179 --> 00:00:16,015
B one: beriberi.

5
00:00:16,015 --> 00:00:22,421
B three: pellagra, the three Ds, dermatitis, diarrhoea, dementia.

6
00:00:22,421 --> 00:00:24,166
C: scurvy.

7
00:00:24,166 --> 00:00:25,651
D: rickets.

8
00:00:25,651 --> 00:00:27,382
Iron: anaemia.

9
00:00:27,382 --> 00:00:32,890
And iodine: goitre, now rare in Nepal thanks to iodised salt.

